        "text": "Celaena Sardothien has become the King’s Champion, but serving him puts her conscience under pressure. She conceals her real loyalties while carrying out a dangerous role at court. Her search for answers draws her friends into conflicts that are difficult to understand and harder to escape. As suspicion spreads around her, she must decide whom to trust and what she is willing to defend. This is the second novel in the Throne of Glass series.",
